>something else?) and be capable of dealing with running small lists.

Postfix as the MTA - simply because it does not relay by default, and all 
config is in one file.  Either Cyrus or Courier as the POP/IMAP 
server.  Mailman seems a popular choice for mailing lists running with 
Postfix, but others are Listar and SmartList.  Majordomo works too, but is 
prolly not the best choice anymore.  The Postfix (www.postfix.org) website 
has loads of docs and Howtos.

