I'm still using 2.4.17 on my XP1000 - hope it's close enough...

> Basically I want to get sound working. Is the sound in an
> xp1000 Soundblaster compatible?

If I remember correctly, it is.  I certainly had the native audio working
on an XP1000 with Linux drivers before installing an SB Live.  I don't
remember for sure which driver I used - I think it was a "100% SB
compatibles" (CONFIG_SOUND_SB).  The ALSA es18xx driver worked too.
The parameters for the sb driver are: io=0x220 irq=5 dma=1 dma16=5.

